## ticket_entry_missing
discord: Choose the channel where members open tickets.
plain:   Choose the channel where members open tickets.
model:   [Fixed("Choose the channel where members open tickets.")]

## ticket_queue_missing
discord: Choose the staff channel for new tickets.
plain:   Choose the staff channel for new tickets.
model:   [Fixed("Choose the staff channel for new tickets.")]

## ticket_same_channel
